<title>USA: Seattle Filmworks sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Seattle Filmworks sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle FilmWorks Inc on Wednesday said its board of directors authorized a three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the split will take the form of a stock dividend to be paid on March 17 to shareholders of record as of March 3.</p>
<p>The company's outstanding shares of common stock will increase to about 16,289,000 as a result of the stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock was up 1/8 at 18 in early afternoon trading on the Nasdaq.</p>
</text>
